'''Akuma Giraffe''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained as a drop reward in stages from the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 518
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Akuma Giraffe
|name2 = Akuma Lion
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Akuma Lion''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat is one of those collaboration units that are used almost solely for [[User Rank]]. Its wave immunity is nice, but its horrible stats prevent it from being of much use against most enemies. Its only other conceivable use as a ranged meatshield on Heavenly Tower [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]], and even then, it's outclassed by talented [[Li'l Cow Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Lion Cat]]. As a rusher, it is outclassed by Lion and Manic Lion because they can actually hit units that are in front of them. Otherwise, its only relevance is being used on early [[Stories of Legend]] 4-crown stages, where the enemies aren't buffed enough to be dangerous; as a cheap knockoff of [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & User Rank Dump}}

