==Trivia==
*His description used to state that he had Wave Shield and Omni Strike, despite having Wave Immunity and Long Distance instead. The Omni Strike was changed to Long Distance in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]], and Wave Shield was changed to Wave Immunity in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].
**Akuma Giraffe's descriptions were again rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "Wave Immunity" was changed to "Immune to Waves".

